OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for killing student
OL,4,Aover fake Rolex row
OL,5,
OL,6,FA student who stabbed his former friend
OL,7,Fthrough the heart in Leicester after
OL,8,Fthey fell out over a fake Rolex watch
OL,9,Fhas been found guilty of manslaughter
OL,10,Fand jailed.
OL,12,FHarper Dennis, 19, plunged a knife five
OL,13,Ftimes into the chest of Khaleed
OL,14,FOladipo, 20, near De Montfort
OL,15,FUniversity in Leicester on the evening
OL,16,Fof February 3 this year.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
