OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for killing student
OL,4,Aover fake Rolex row
OL,5,
OL,6,FA jury at Leicester Crown Court found
OL,7,FDennis not guilty of murder but guilty
OL,8,Fof manslaughter, having an offensive
OL,9,Fweapon and failing to provide the pin
OL,10,Fto his phone after a two-week trial on
OL,11,FTuesday.
OL,13,FDennis, of Bath Lane, Leicester, was
OL,14,Fsentenced to a total of 10 years'
OL,15,Fimprisonment.
